description:
Returns the title, channel, duration and full transcript (subtitles or automatic captions) of a public YouTube video, with a timestamp every 30 seconds. In the video's original language by default; can translate the captions (lang).
Use when: you need to know what is said in a YouTube video, summarize it or quote it.
Example: {"video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"}
